<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Zacharie</para>
  <para style="toc1">ZACHARIE</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zacharie</para>
  <para style="toc3">Za</para>
  <para style="mt1">ZACHARIE</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ZEC 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:1" />Nan uityèm mwa, dezyèm ane Wa Darius la, pawòl SENYÈ a te vini a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 5:1">Esd 5:1</ref></char></note>Zacharie, pwofèt la, fis a Bérékia, fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 12:4">Né 12:4</ref>,<ref loc="NEH 12:16">16</ref> </char></note>Iddo a. Li te di: <verse eid="ZEC 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:2" />“SENYÈ a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">II Kwo 36:16</ref> </char></note>fache anpil anpil avèk zansèt nou yo. <verse eid="ZEC 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:3" />Konsa, se pou ou di a yo menm: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 31:6">És 31:6</ref> </char></note>“Retounen vin jwenn Mwen,” deklare SENYÈ dèzame yo: “Pou M kapab retounen vin jwenn nou,” pale SENYÈ dèzame yo. <verse eid="ZEC 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:4" />“Pa fè tankou zansèt nou yo, a sila ansyen pwofèt yo te kriye e te di: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo: ‘Retounen koulye a, kite chemen mechan ak zak mechan nou yo.’ Men yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:17">Jr 6:17</ref> </char></note>pa t koute, ni okipe Mwen’, deklare SENYÈ a.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:16-19">És 1:16-19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:5" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 5:7">Lam 5:7</ref></char></note>Papa zansèt nou yo, ki kote yo ye? Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:52">Jn 8:52</ref> </char></note>pwofèt yo, èske yo viv pou tout tan? <verse eid="ZEC 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:6" />Men èske pawòl Mwen yo, ak règleman Mwen yo, lòd ke M te bay a sèvitè Mwen yo, pwofèt yo, èske yo pa t depase zansèt nou yo?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:6">“Konsa yo te repanti, e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 2:17">Lam 2:17</ref> </char></note>‘Jan SENYÈ dèzame yo te gen entansyon fè ak nou selon chemen ak zak nou yo, se konsa Li fin aji avèk nou.’”<verse eid="ZEC 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:7" />Nan venn-katriyèm jou nan onzyèm mwa a, ki se mwa Schebat a, nan dezyèm ane wa Darius la, pawòl SENYÈ a te rive kote Zacharie, pwofèt la, fis a Bérékia, fis a Iddo a, konsa: <verse eid="ZEC 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:8" />Mwen t ap gade pandan nwit lan e vwala, yon nonm te monte sou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 6:2">Za 6:2</ref></char></note>cheval wouj. Li te kanpe pami pye Jasmen ki te nan ravin yo, e dèyè li, te gen cheval wouj, cheval alzan ak cheval <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:2">Rev 6:2</ref> </char></note>blan.<verse eid="ZEC 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:9" />Konsa, mwen te di: “O Senyè mwen an! Se kisa sa yo ye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:9">Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 2:3">Za 2:3</ref> </char></note>zanj ki t ap pale avèk mwen an, te di mwen: “Mwen va montre ou kisa yo ye.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:10" />Epi nonm ki te kanpe pami pye Jasmen yo te reponn. Li te di: “Sa yo se sila ke SENYÈ a te voye pou fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:7">Job 1:7</ref> </char></note>patwouj sou latè.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:11" />Konsa, yo te reponn zanj SENYÈ, ki te kanpe pami pye Jasmen yo. Yo te di: “Nou te fè patwouj sou tè a e gade byen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:7">És 14:7</ref> </char></note>tout tè a kalm. Li gen lapè.” <verse eid="ZEC 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:12" />Epi zanj SENYÈ a te di: “O SENYÈ dèzame yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 74:10">Sòm 74:10</ref></char></note> pandan konbyen de tan Ou va refize gen konpasyon pou Jérusalem ak vil a Juda yo, de kilès Ou te si tèlman pa t kontan pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:11">Jr 25:11</ref> </char></note>swasann-dis ane sila yo?”<verse eid="ZEC 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:13" />SENYÈ a te reponn zanj ki t ap pale avè m nan ak pawòl ki plen gras, pawòl dous ki pou kalme.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:1">És 40:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 40:2">2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:14" />Konsa, zanj ki t ap pale avè m nan, te di mwen: “Se pou ou kriye pou di: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo: “Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 8:2">Za 8:2</ref> </char></note>jalou depase pou Jérusalem ak Sion. <verse eid="ZEC 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:15" />Men Mwen fache anpil anpil ak nasyon ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 123:4">Sòm 123:4</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:11">Am 1:11</ref> </char></note> alèz yo. Paske pandan Mwen te fache sèlman yon ti kras, yo te ogmante afliksyon an.” <verse eid="ZEC 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:16" />Akoz sa, SENYÈ a di konsa: “Mwen ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:8-10">És 54:8-10</ref></char></note>retounen kote Jérusalem, ak mizerikòd. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 6:14">Esd 6:14</ref>,<ref loc="EZR 6:15">15</ref> </char></note>Kay Mwen an va bati ladann l”, deklare SENYÈ dèzame yo; “ epi yon lign va vin tire sou Jérusalem.”’<verse eid="ZEC 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:17" />“Se pou ou kriye ankò e di: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:26">És 44:26</ref> </char></note>“Vil Mwen yo va vin debòde ak abondans ankò. SENYÈ a va soulaje Sion, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 2:12">Za 2:12</ref> </char></note>chwazi Jérusalem ankò.”’”<verse eid="ZEC 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:18" />Konsa, Mwen te leve zye m; mwen te gade, e konsa, te gen kat kòn. <verse eid="ZEC 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:19" />Mwen te di a zanj ki t ap pale avè m nan: “Kisa sa yo ye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:19">Li te reponn mwen: “Sa yo se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:11">I Wa 22:11</ref> </char></note>kòn ki te gaye Juda, Israël, ak Jérusalem yo.” <verse eid="ZEC 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:20" />SENYÈ a te montre mwen kat <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:12">És 44:12</ref> </char></note>gwo bòs fòjewon. <verse eid="ZEC 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:21" />Mwen te di: “Se kisa sa yo ap vin fè?” Epi li te di: “Sa yo se kòn ki te gaye Juda yo pou pèsòn pa t leve tèt yo. Men bòs fòjewon sila yo ki te vini pou teworize yo, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 75:10">Sòm 75:10</ref> </char></note>fonn kòn a nasyon ki te leve kòn yo kont peyi Juda pou te gaye li a.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ZEC 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:1" />Konsa, Mwen te leve zye m gade, e vwala, te gen yon nonm ak yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:39">Jr 31:39</ref> </char></note>lign mezi nan men l. <verse eid="ZEC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:2" />Konsa mwen te di: “Ki kote ou prale la a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 2:2">Li te di mwen: “Pou mezire Jérusalem, pou wè ki lajè li genyen, ak longè li.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:39">Jr 31:39</ref></char></note><verse eid="ZEC 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:3" />Epi vwala <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:9">Za 1:9</ref> </char></note>zanj ki t ap pale avèk mwen an te sòti, e yon lòt zanj te vin parèt pou rankontre avè l. <verse eid="ZEC 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:4" />Li te di li: “Kouri pale ak jennonm sa a, pou di l: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:17">Za 1:17</ref></char></note>‘Jérusalem va vin plen moun tankou vilaj ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 38:11">Éz 38:11</ref> </char></note>san miray, akoz kantite moun ak bèt k ap rete ladann. <verse eid="ZEC 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:5" />Paske Mwen menm’, deklare SENYÈ a: ‘Mwen va devni yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 4:5">És 4:5</ref> </char></note>miray dife k ap antoure fi a, e Mwen va laglwa nan mitan l.<verse eid="ZEC 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:6" />“‘Vini! Vini! <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:18">Jr 3:18</ref> </char></note>Sove ale kite peyi nò a,’ deklare SENYÈ a: ‘paske Mwen te gaye nou tankou kat van syèl yo,’ deklare SENYÈ a. <verse eid="ZEC 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:7" />‘Vini Sion! <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 48:20">És 48:20</ref> </char></note>Kouri chape poul nou, nou ki rete ak fi a Babylone nan.’ <verse eid="ZEC 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:8" />Paske konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo: ‘Dèyè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:7-9">És 60:7-9</ref> </char></note>glwa pa Li a, Li te voye mwen kont nasyon k ap piyaje nou yo, paske sila ki touche ou a, te touche ponm de zye tèt Li. <verse eid="ZEC 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:9" />Paske, gade byen, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 19:16">És 19:16</ref></char></note>souke men M sou yo, e yo va vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:2">És 14:2</ref> </char></note>piyaj pou sila ki te sèvi yo. Epi konsa, ou va konnen ke se SENYÈ dèzame yo ki te voye Mwen. <verse eid="ZEC 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:10" />Chante ak lajwa e fè kè ou kontan, O fi a Sion an! Paske, gade byen, Mwen ap vini, e Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 2:5">Za 2:5</ref> </char></note>rete nan mitan nou,’ deklare SENYÈ a. <verse eid="ZEC 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 4:2">Mi 4:2</ref> </char></note>Anpil nasyon va vin jwenn yo ak SENYÈ a nan jou sa a, e va devni pèp Mwen. Epi Mwen va demere nan mitan nou, e nou va konnen ke se SENYÈ dèzame yo ki te voye Mwen kote nou. <verse eid="ZEC 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:12" />SENYÈ a va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:9">Det 32:9</ref></char></note>posede Juda kon pòsyon pa Li nan peyi sen an, e Li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:6">II Kwo 6:6</ref> </char></note>chwazi Jérusalem ankò. <verse eid="ZEC 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:13" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:20">Hab 2:20</ref> </char></note>Se pou nou fè silans, tout chè, devan SENYÈ a; paske Li gen tan leve nan abitasyon sen Li an.”<verse eid="ZEC 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ZEC 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:1" />Konsa, li te montre mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 5:2">Esd 5:2</ref></char></note>Josué, wo prèt ki te kanpe devan zanj SENYÈ a, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 21:1">I Kwo 21:1</ref> </char></note>Satan ki te kanpe sou men dwat li pou akize li. <verse eid="ZEC 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:2" />SENYÈ a te di a Satan: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 4:11">Am 4:11</ref> </char></note>“SENYÈ a repwoche ou, Satan! Anverite, SENYÈ ki te chwazi Jérusalem nan va repwoche ou! Èske sa se pa yon bout bwa cho ki retire soti nan dife?”<verse eid="ZEC 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:3" />Alò, Josué te abiye ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:15">Esd 9:15</ref> </char></note>rad sal, e te kanpe devan zanj lan. <verse eid="ZEC 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:4" />Li te pale, e te di a sila ki te kanpe devan l yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 43:25">És 43:25</ref></char></note>“Retire rad sal yo sou li.” A li menm Li te di, “Gade byen, Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:18">Mi 7:18</ref>,<ref loc="MIC 7:19">19</ref> </char></note>retire inikite sou ou, e Mwen va abiye ou ak vètman byen chè.”<verse eid="ZEC 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:5" />Mwen te di: “Kite yo mete yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 29:14">Job 29:14</ref></char></note>tiban pwòp sou tèt li.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 3:5">Konsa, yo te mete yon tiban pwòp sou tèt li, e yo te abiye li. Zanj SENYÈ a te kanpe sou kote.<verse eid="ZEC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:6" />Zanj SENYÈ a ak vwa solanèl te asire Josué. Li te di: <verse eid="ZEC 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:7" />“Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo: ‘Si ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:14">I Wa 3:14</ref> </char></note>mache nan chemen Mwen yo, si ou va fè sèvis Mwen, alò, ou va osi gouvène lakay Mwen an. Ou va osi gadyen lakou Mwen an, e ou va gen lib aksè pami tout sila ki kanpe la yo. <verse eid="ZEC 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:8" />Alò koute, Josué, wo prèt la, ou menm ak zanmi ki chita devan ou yo—anverite, yo se moun ki sèvi kon yon sign. Paske gade byen, Mwen va fè parèt sèvitè Mwen an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:1">És 11:1</ref> </char></note>Scion an. <verse eid="ZEC 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:9" />Paske gade byen, wòch ke Mwen te plase devan Josué a; sou yon sèl wòch, gen sèt zye. Gade byen, men mo a, Mwen va fè grave sou li,’ deklare SENYÈ dèzame yo. ‘Epi Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:34">Jr 31:34</ref> </char></note>retire inikite a peyi sa a nan yon sèl jou. <verse eid="ZEC 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:10" />Nan jou sa a,’ deklare SENYÈ dèzame yo: ‘nou chak va envite vwazen nou yo pou vin chita anba <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:25">I Wa 4:25</ref> </char></note>pye rezen an ak anba pye fig pa nou.’”<verse eid="ZEC 3:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ZEC 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:1" />Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:9">Za 1:9</ref></char></note>zanj ki t ap pale avè m nan te retounen. E te Li te fè m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:5-7">I Wa 19:5-7</ref> </char></note>Leve tankou yon nonm yo te leve soti nan dòmi. <verse eid="ZEC 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:2" />Li te di m: “Kisa ou wè?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:2">Mwen te di: “Mwen te wè e vwala, yon chandelye ki fèt nèt an lò, avèk bòl li sou tèt li, ak sèt lanp li yo. Gen sèt bobèch pou chak lanp ki sou li yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:31">Egz 25:31</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 25:37">37</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:5">Rev 4:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:3" />Anplis, gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 4:11">Za 4:11</ref> </char></note>de bwa doliv yo sou kote li, youn sou kote dwat bòl la, e lòt la sou kote goch la.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:4" />Mwen te di a zanj ki t ap pale avè m nan. Mwen te di: “Kisa sa yo ye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:9">Za 1:9</ref> </char></note>mèt mwen?”<verse eid="ZEC 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:5" />Konsa, zanj ki t ap pale avè m nan te reponn. Li te di m: “Èske ou pa konnen kisa sa yo ye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:5">Mwen te reponn: “Non, mèt mwen.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:9">Za 1:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="ZEC 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:6" />Epi li te di m: “Sa se pawòl SENYÈ a Zorobabel la ki di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:2-4">És 11:2-4</ref></char></note>‘Se pa pa lafòs, ni pa pwisans, men pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:7-8">II Kwo 32:7-8</ref></char></note>Lespri Mwen,’ pale SENYÈ dèzame yo. <verse eid="ZEC 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:7" />‘Se kilès ou ye, O gran montay la? Devan Zorobabel, ou va vin tounen tè pla. Konsa, li va fè vin parèt ak wòch prensipal la, ak gwo kri k ap di: “Gras, gras a li!”’”<verse eid="ZEC 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:8" />Anplis, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="ZEC 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:9" />“Men a Zorobabel te poze fondasyon kay sa. Se men l k ap fin fè l. Konsa, ou va konnen ke se SENYÈ dèzame yo ki te voye mwen kote ou. <verse eid="ZEC 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:10" />Paske se kilès ki te meprize jou a ti bagay yo? Men sèt sila yo va rejwi lè yo wè liy a plòn an nan men Zorobabel. Sa yo se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 16:9">II Kwo 16:9</ref></char></note>zye SENYÈ a k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:10">Za 1:10</ref> </char></note>veye toupatou sou tout tè a.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:11" />Mwen te di li: “Se kisa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 4:3">Za 4:3</ref> </char></note>de bwa doliv sila yo ki sou kote dwat ak sou kote goch a chandelye yo ye?”<verse eid="ZEC 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:12" />Mwen te mande l yon dezyèm fwa. Mwen te di li: “Se kisa de branch doliv sila yo ki sou kote de tij an lò k ap vide lwil an lò k ap soti nan yo a?”<verse eid="ZEC 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:13" />Li te reponn mwen, e te di: “Èske ou pa konnen kisa yo ye?” Mwen te di: “Non mèt mwen.” <verse eid="ZEC 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:14" />Li te di: “Sa yo se de moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:7">Egz 29:7</ref> </char></note>onksyone yo ki kanpe akote Mèt a tout tè a.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ZEC 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:1" />Answit, mwen te leve zye m ankò. Mwen te gade e mwen te wè, yon liv woulo ki t ap vole anlè. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:2">Jr 36:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:2" />Konsa, li te di mwen: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 4:2">Za 4:2</ref></char></note>“Kisa ou wè la a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 5:2">Mwen te reponn: “Mwen wè yon liv woulo k ap vole anlè; longè li se ven koude, e lajè li se dis koude.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:3" />Li te di mwen: “Sa se malediksyon k ap vin parèt sou fas a tout tè a. Anverite, tout moun ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:15">Egz 20:15</ref></char></note>vòlè va vin koupe retire nan yon bò selon li; epi tout moun ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:12">Lev 19:12</ref> </char></note>fè fo sèman va vin koupe retire nan lòt bò a selon li. <verse eid="ZEC 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:4" />Mwen va fè li vin parèt”, deklare SENYÈ dèzame yo: “Epi li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 4:2">Os 4:2</ref>,<ref loc="HOS 4:3">3</ref></char></note>antre lakay a vòlè a ak lakay a sila ki fè fo sèman nan non Mwen an. Konsa, li va rete nèt nan mitan kay li a, e li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:34">Lev 14:34</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 14:35">35</ref> </char></note>detwi l nèt ansanm ak bwa travès ak tout wòch yo.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:5" />Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:9">Za 1:9</ref> </char></note>zanj ki t ap pale avè m nan te sòti deyò. Li te di mwen: “Koulye a leve zye ou pou wè sa k ap vin parèt la.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:6" />Mwen te di: “Kisa li ye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 5:6">Li te di: “Sa se panyen efa a k ap vin parèt la.” Li te di ankò: “Sa se inikite ki nan tout peyi a.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:36">Lev 19:36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:7" />Epi vwala, yon kouvèti an plon ki peze yon talan (40 kilo) te vin leve. Epi te gen yon fanm ki chita nan mitan panyen an”.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 12:7">Os 12:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:8" />Zanj la te di: “Sa se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 12:7">Os 12:7</ref> </char></note>Mechanste!” Epi li te jete fanm nan rive nan mitan panyen efa a, e li te voye mas plon an sou bouch panyen an.<verse eid="ZEC 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:9" />Mwen te leve zye m, mwen te gade, e mwen te wè te gen de fanm ak van nan zèl yo. Zèl yo te tankou zèl a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11:13">Lev 11:13</ref> </char></note>sigòy. Konsa, yo te leve panyen efa a antre tè a ak syèl la. <verse eid="ZEC 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:10" />Mwen te di a zanj ki t ap pale avè m nan: “Se ki kote yo prale ak panyen an la a?”<verse eid="ZEC 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:11" />Li te di mwen: “Pou bati yon tanp pou fanm nan, nan peyi Schinear. Konsa, lè l fin prepare, fi la va pozisyone la sou pwòp baz pa l.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ZEC 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:1" />Alò, mwen te leve zye m ankò pou m te gade, e vwala <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:3">Dan 7:3</ref> </char></note>te gen kat cha ki t ap soti parèt antre de mòn. Mòn yo te mòn ki fèt an bwonz. <verse eid="ZEC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:2" />Nan premye cha a, te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:8">Za 1:8</ref> </char></note>cheval wouj. Nan dezyèm cha a, te gen cheval nwa. <verse eid="ZEC 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:3" />Nan twazyèm cha a te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:2">Rev 6:2</ref> </char></note>cheval blan. Nan katriyèm cha a, te gen cheval takte yo, tout nan yo byen dyanm. <verse eid="ZEC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:4" />Konsa mwen te pale. Mwen te di a zanj ki t ap pale avè m nan: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:9">Za 1:9</ref> </char></note>“Kisa sa yo ye, mèt mwen?”<verse eid="ZEC 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:5" />Zanj lan te reponn mwen. Li te di: “Sa yo se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:36">Jr 49:36</ref> </char></note>kat lespri a syèl yo k ap prale soti devan Senyè a tout tè a. <verse eid="ZEC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:6" />Cha kote cheval nwa yo ye a ap prale nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:14">Jr 1:14</ref>,<ref loc="JER 1:15">15</ref></char></note>peyi nò a, epi blan yo te soti dèyè yo. Epi takte yo ap prale nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 43:6">És 43:6</ref> </char></note>peyi sid la.” <verse eid="ZEC 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:7" />Konsa, cheval ki dyanm yo te ale. Yo te sòti pou yo ta ka <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:10">Za 1:10</ref> </char></note>mache ale retou sou tout latè. Konsa, yo te mache ale retou sou latè a.<verse eid="ZEC 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:8" />Answit, li te rele m. Li te pale pou di m: “Gade byen, yo se sila k ap prale vè peyi nò a, e yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:13">Éz 5:13</ref> </char></note>apeze chalè kòlè Mwen nan peyi nò a.”<verse eid="ZEC 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:9" />Anplis, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:1">Za 1:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:14-16">Esd 7:14-16</ref> </char></note>“Pran yon ofrann soti nan egzile yo, soti nan Heldaï, Tobija, ak Jedaeja. Ale nan menm jou a e antre lakay Josias, fis a Sophonie an, kote yo soti Babylone nan. <verse eid="ZEC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:11" />Pran ajan ak lò, fè yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:30">II Sam 12:30</ref> </char></note>kouwòn byen bèl, e mete li sou tèt a Josué, fis a Jotsadak la, wo prèt la. <verse eid="ZEC 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:12" />Epi di a li menm: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo: “Gade byen, nonm ki gen non ki rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 4:2">És 4:2</ref> </char></note>Scion an. Li va grandi soti kote Li ye a, e Li va bati tanp SENYÈ a. <verse eid="ZEC 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:13" />Wi, se Li menm ki va bati tanp SENYÈ a. Li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:6">És 9:6</ref></char></note>pote laglwa, e Li va chita pou gouvène sou twòn Li an. Konsa, Li va yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sòm 110:1</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 110:4">4</ref> </char></note>prèt ki chita sou twòn Li, e konsey lapè a va antre yo de (2).’” <verse eid="ZEC 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:14" />Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 6:11">Za 6:11</ref> </char></note>kouwòn yo va devni yon souvni nan tanp SENYÈ a pou Hélem, Tobija, Jedaeja, Hen, fis a Sophonie an.<verse eid="ZEC 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:15" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 56:6-8">És 56:6-8</ref> </char>
    </note>Sila ki lwen yo va vin bati nan tanp SENYÈ a.” Konsa ou va konnen ke se SENYÈ dèzame yo ki te voye mwen vè nou. Sa va vin rive si nou obeyi nèt SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an.<verse eid="ZEC 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ZEC 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:1" />Nan katriyèm ane wa Darius la, pawòl SENYÈ a te vini a Zacharie, nan katriyèm jou nevyèm mwa a, ki se Kisleu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 1:1">Né 1:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:2" />Alò, vil Béthel te voye Scharetser, Réguem-Mélec avèk moun pa yo pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:6">I Wa 13:6</ref> </char></note>chache favè SENYÈ a, <verse eid="ZEC 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:3" />pou li te pale ak prèt ki apatyen a lakay SENYÈ Dèzame Yo, a pwofèt yo pou di: “Èske mwen ta dwe kriye nan senkyèm mwa a, pou mete m apa, menm jan mwen te fè l pandan tout lane sa yo?”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 3:10-12">Esd 3:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 8:19">Za 8:19</ref> </char></note><verse eid="ZEC 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:4" />Konsa, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="ZEC 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:5" />“Di a tout pèp peyi a, e a prèt yo: ‘Lè nou te fè jèn ak lamantasyon nan senkyèm jou nan setyèm mwa yo, pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:12">Za 1:12</ref></char></note>swasann-dis ane sila yo, èske se te vrèman pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:11">És 1:11</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 1:12">12</ref> </char></note>Mwen ke nou te fè jèn nan? <verse eid="ZEC 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:6" />Lè nou manje ak bwè, èske nou pa manje pou pwòp tèt nou, e èske nou pa bwè pou pwòp tèt nou? <verse eid="ZEC 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:7" />Èske se pa pawòl sila yo ke SENYÈ a te pwoklame pa ansyen pwofèt yo, lè Jérusalem te gen anpil moun, e t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:21">Jr 22:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 13:19">Jr 13:19</ref> </char></note>pwospere ansanm ak vil ki te antoure li yo, e lè Negev ak ti kolin yo te gen moun ki t ap viv ladan yo?’”<verse eid="ZEC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:8" />Epi pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote Zacharie. Li te di: <verse eid="ZEC 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:9" />“Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:8">Éz 18:8</ref></char></note>‘Ekzekite vrè jijman, e pratike <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:7">II Sam 9:7</ref> </char></note>ladousè ak konpasyon, chak moun anvè frè li. <verse eid="ZEC 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:22">Egz 22:22</ref></char></note>Pa oprime ni vèv, ni òfelen, ni etranje, ni malere. Ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 21:11">Sòm 21:11</ref> </char></note> pa kite pèsòn nan nou panse mal nan kè li, youn kont lòt.’ <verse eid="ZEC 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:11" />Men yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:3">Jr 5:3</ref> </char></note>refize koute sa. Yo te leve zepòl yo, e te bouche zòrèy yo pou yo pa tande. <verse eid="ZEC 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:12" />Yo te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:13">II Kwo 36:13</ref></char></note>kè yo di tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:1">Jr 17:1</ref> </char></note>silèks pou yo pa tande lalwa ak zèv ke SENYÈ dèzame yo te voye pa Lespri Li pa ansyen pwofèt yo. Akoz sa, chalè a gwo kòlè a te sòti nan SENYÈ dèzame yo. <verse eid="ZEC 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:13" />Epi menm jan Li te rele pou yo pa koute, konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 1:24-28">Pwov 1:24-28</ref> </char></note>yo va rele, e Mwen p ap koute, pale SENYÈ dèzame yo. <verse eid="ZEC 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:14" />Men Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:27">Det 4:27</ref></char></note>gaye yo ak yon van tanpèt pami tout nasyon ke yo pa t konnen yo. Se konsa peyi a te vin dezole dèyè yo pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:15">És 60:15</ref> </char></note>pèsòn moun pa t fè ale vini ladann. Paske yo te fè bèl peyi a vin dezole nèt.”<verse eid="ZEC 7:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ZEC 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:1" />Pawòl SENYÈ Dèzame yo te vini kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="ZEC 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:2" />Konsa pale SENYÈ Dèzame yo: “Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:14">Za 1:14</ref> </char></note>jalou anpil pou Sion; wi, ak gwo kòlè Mwen jalou pou li.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:3" />Konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Mwen fin retounen nan Sion, e Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 2:10">Za 2:10</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 2:11">11</ref> </char></note>demere nan mitan Jérusalem. Jérusalem va rele ‘Vil Verite a, e Mòn SENYÈ Dèzame yo, yo va rele ‘Mòn Sen an.’”<verse eid="ZEC 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:4" />Konsa pale SENYÈ Dèzame yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:20">És 65:20</ref> </char></note>“Va gen ni granmoun gason, ni granmoun fanm nan ri a Jérusalem yo. Chak gason ak baton nan men l akoz anpil laj li. <verse eid="ZEC 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:5" />Epi ri vil yo va vin ranpli ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:19">Jr 30:19</ref>,<ref loc="JER 30:20">20</ref> </char></note>jenn gason, e jenn fi k ap jwe nan ri yo tou.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:6" />Konsa pale SENYÈ Dèzame yo: “Si sa parèt etonnan nan zye a retay pèp sila a, nan jou sa yo, èske sa va parèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:17">Jr 32:17</ref>,<ref loc="JER 32:27">27</ref> </char></note>etonnan tou nan zye pa m?” deklare SENYÈ Dèzame yo.<verse eid="ZEC 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:7" />Konsa pale SENYÈ Dèzame yo: “Gade byen, Mwen va sove pèp Mwen soti nan peyi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 107:3">Sòm 107:3</ref> </char></note>lès la, e soti nan peyi lwès la. <verse eid="ZEC 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:8" />Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 3:20">So 3:20</ref></char></note>mennen yo vin rete nan mitan Jérusalem. Yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:20">Éz 11:20</ref> </char></note>pèp Mwen, e Mwen va Bondye yo nan laverite ak ladwati.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:9" />Konsa pale SENYÈ Dèzame yo: “Kite men nou vin dyanm, nou menm k ap koute nan jou sa yo, pawòl sa yo ki soti nan bouch a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 5:1">Esd 5:1</ref> </char></note>pwofèt ki te pale nan jou ke fondasyon kay SENYÈ Dèzame yo te poze a, menm tanp lan, pou li te kapab vin bati. <verse eid="ZEC 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:10" />Paske avan jou sa yo, pa t gen salè pou moun, pa t gen salè bèt; pa t gen lapè nonplis pou sila ki t ap antre oswa ki t ap soti, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:5">II Kwo 15:5</ref></char></note> akoz lènmi li yo. Paske Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 19:2">És 19:2</ref> </char></note>te mete tout moun kont pwochen yo. <verse eid="ZEC 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:11" />Men koulye a, Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 103:9">Sòm 103:9</ref> </char></note>p ap aji ak retay pèp sa a tankou nan tan ansyen yo,” deklare SENYÈ Dèzame yo. <verse eid="ZEC 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:12" />“Paske va gen semans <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:3-6">Lev 26:3-6</ref></char></note>lapè; pye rezen an va bay fwi li, peyi a va fè pwodiksyon pa l, e syèl yo va bay lawouze yo. Konsa, Mwen va fè retay a pèp sa a vin eritye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:7">És 61:7</ref> </char></note>tout bagay sa yo. <verse eid="ZEC 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:13" />Li va vin rive ke menm jan nou te yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:18">Jr 29:18</ref></char></note>madichon pami nasyon yo, O lakay Juda, konsa Mwen va sove nou, pou nou kapab devni yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 72:17">Sòm 72:17</ref> </char></note>benediksyon. Pa pè, men kite men nou rete dyanm.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:14" />Paske konsa pale SENYÈ Dèzame yo: “Menm jan ke Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:28">Jr 31:28</ref></char></note>gen entansyon fè nou mal lè papa zansèt nou yo te pwovoke Mwen a lakòlè a,” pale SENYÈ Dèzame yo, “epi Mwen pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:28">Jr 4:28</ref> </char></note>t ap repanti, <verse eid="ZEC 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:15" />konsa ankò, Mwen te pran desizyon nan jou sila yo pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:11">Jr 29:11</ref> </char></note>fè byen pou Jérusalem ak lakay Juda. Pa pè! <verse eid="ZEC 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:16" />Sa yo se bagay ke nou va fè yo: pale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 15:2">Sòm 15:2</ref></char></note>verite a youn lòt, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:7">És 9:7</ref> </char></note>egzekite jijman pou laverite ak lapè nan pòtay nou yo. <verse eid="ZEC 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:17" />Anplis, ke pèsòn nan nou pa fè plan mal nan kè li kont pwochen li, ni pa renmen fo sèman nan jijman. Paske tout sa yo se bagay ke M rayi,” deklare SENYÈ a.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:29">Pwov 3:29</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 5:4">Za 5:4</ref> </char></note><verse eid="ZEC 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:18" />Epi pawòl SENYÈ Dèzame yo te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="ZEC 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:19" />Konsa pale SENYÈ Dèzame yo: “Jèn nan katriyèm mwa a, jèn nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 7:3">Za 7:3</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 7:5">5</ref></char></note>senkyèm mwa a, jèn nan setyèm mwa a, e jèn nan dizyèm mwa yo va devni pou lakay Juda gwo lajwa, kè kontan ak gwo fèt rejwisans; Donk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:74">Luc 1:74</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 1:75">75</ref> </char></note>lanmou, laverite ak lapè.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:20" />Konsa pale SENYÈ Dèzame yo: “Li va toujou rive ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 117:1">Sòm 117:1</ref> </char></note>pèp nasyon yo va vini, pèp a anpil vil. <verse eid="ZEC 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:21" />Pèp k ap viv nan yon nasyon va ale nan yon lòt e va di: ‘Annou ale vit <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 7:2">Za 7:2</ref> </char></note>chache favè SENYÈ a, e chache SENYÈ Dèzame yo. Mwen menm tou, mwen prale.’ <verse eid="ZEC 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:22" />Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:2">És 2:2</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 2:3">3</ref></char></note>anpil pèp ak nasyon pwisan va vin chache SENYÈ Dèzame yo nan Jérusalem, e pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 8:21">Za 8:21</ref> </char></note>mande favè SENYÈ a.” <verse eid="ZEC 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:23" />Konsa pale SENYÈ Dèzame yo: “Nan jou sila yo, dis mesye ki nan tout nasyon yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:14-24">És 45:14-24</ref> </char></note>kenbe vètman an sila ki Jwif la, e va di: ‘Na p ale avèk ou, paske nou tande ke Bondye avèk ou.”’<verse eid="ZEC 8:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ZEC 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:1" />Yon revelasyon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:1">Pawòl SENYÈ a kont peyi Hadrac la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:1">e l ap poze sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 17:1">És 17:1</ref></char></note>Damas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:1">paske zye a lòm ak tout trib Israël</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:1">se vè SENYÈ a,<verse eid="ZEC 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:2" />epi osi vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:23">Jr 49:23</ref></char></note>Hamath, ki nan lizyè li a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:2">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 28:2-5">Éz 28:2-5</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 28:12">12</ref> </char>
    </note>Tyr ak Sidon paske yo saj anpil.<verse eid="ZEC 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:3" />Paske Tyr te bati pou kont li yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:29">Jos 19:29</ref></char></note>fò;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:3">li te fè depo ajan tankou pousyè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:3">ak depo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:21">I Wa 10:21</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 10:27">27</ref> </char></note>lò tankou labou nan lari.<verse eid="ZEC 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:4" />Gade byen, SENYÈ a va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:3-5">Éz 26:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 28:18">És 28:18</ref></char></note>rache</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:4">tout sa li posede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:4">e jete tout richès li yo nan lanmè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:4">Li va devore nèt ak dife a.<verse eid="ZEC 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:5" />Askalon va wè l e vin pè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:5">Anplis, gaza va tòde ak gwo doulè;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:5">epi Ékron, pou sa li te atann va desi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:5">Anplis ke sa, wa a va peri Gaza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:5">e Askalon va vin pa gen moun.<verse eid="ZEC 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:6" />Yon ras mele va vin rete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 1:8">Am 1:8</ref></char></note>Asdod</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:6">e Mwen va rache ògèy a Filisten yo.<verse eid="ZEC 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:7" />Mwen va retire san li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:7">soti nan bouch li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:7">ak abominasyon soti nan mitan dan l yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:7">Konsa, yo va devni osi yon retay</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:7">pou Bondye nou an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:7">Yo va tankou yon chèf pou Juda, e</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:7">Ékron va tankou Jebizyen yo.<verse eid="ZEC 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:8" />Mwen va kanpe antoure kay Mwen an kont lame a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:8">pou pèsòn moun pa travèse oswa retounen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:8">Konsa, p ap gen moun k ap travèse pou oprime yo ankò.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:8">Paske koulye a, ak zye pa m, Mwen wè.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:14">És 54:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="ZEC 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:9" />Rejwi anpil, O fi a Sion an!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">Kriye yon son viktwa, O fi a Sion an!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">Gade byen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sòm 110:1</ref> </char></note>wa ou ap vini kote ou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 3:5">So 3:5</ref></char></note>jis e Li gen Sali;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">Li enb e Li monte sou yon bourik,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">menm yon jenn pòtre,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">pitit a yon bourik.<verse eid="ZEC 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:10" />Mwen va koupe retire cha Éphraïm nan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">ansanm ak cheval Jérusalem nan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">Banza lagè a va koupe retire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">Li va pale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:19">És 57:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 72:8">Sòm 72:8</ref></char></note>lapè a nasyon yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">Wayòm Li an va soti nan lanmè jis rive nan lanmè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">e nan Rivyè Euphrate la jis pou l</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">rive nan dènye pwent tè a.<verse eid="ZEC 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:11" />Menmjan an pou ou menm tou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:11">akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Egz 24:8</ref></char></note>san akò Mwen an ki avèk ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:11">Mwen te mete prizonye ou yo an libète</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:11">soti nan twou fòs ki pa gen dlo a.<verse eid="ZEC 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:12" />Retounen nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 16:19">Jr 16:19</ref></char></note>sitadèl la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:12">O prizonye ki gen lespwa a!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:12">Nan jou sa a menm, Mwen deklare</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:12">ke Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:7">És 61:7</ref> </char></note>remèt ou doub de sa.<verse eid="ZEC 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:13" />Paske Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:20">Jr 51:20</ref> </char></note>koube Juda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:13">konsi se te banza Mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:13">Mwen te plen banza a avèk Éphraïm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:13">Mwen va fè leve fis ou yo, O Sion,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:13">kont fis ou yo, O Grèce,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:13">e Mwen va fè ou vin tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 45:3">Sòm 45:3</ref></char></note>nepe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:13">a yon gèrye pwisan.<verse eid="ZEC 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:14" />Epi SENYÈ a va vin parèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 31:5">És 31:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:14">Sòm 18:14</ref></char></note>sou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:14">e flèch Li va pati tankou kout loray.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:14">Senyè BONDYE a va sone twonpèt la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:14">e Li va mache nan van tanpèt sid yo.<verse eid="ZEC 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:15" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 37:35">És 37:35</ref> </char>
    </note>SENYÈ dèzame yo va defann yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">Yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:6">Za 12:6</ref></char></note>devore, e yo va foule anba pye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">ak tout wòch fistibal yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">Yo va bwè, e fè bwi tankou se diven y ap bwè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">Epi yo va vin ranpli tankou basen sakrifis,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">tankou kwen lotèl yo.<verse eid="ZEC 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:16" />Konsa SENYÈ a, Bondye yo a, va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:10">Jr 31:10</ref>,<ref loc="JER 31:11">11</ref></char></note>sove yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:16">nan jou sa a, tankou foul moun a pèp Li a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:16">paske yo tankou wòch presye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:16">bijou yon kouwòn k ap klere toupatou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:16">anwo tout peyi Li a.<verse eid="ZEC 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:17" />Paske a la gran, bonte Li va gran,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:17">e a la gran, bèlte Li va gran!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:17">Sereyal la va fè jenn mesye yo pwospere</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:17">ak diven nèf pou vyèj yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:12">Jr 31:12</ref>,<ref loc="JER 31:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 27:4">Sòm 27:4</ref> </char></note><verse eid="ZEC 9:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ZEC 10" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:1" />Mande pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:23">Jl 2:23</ref> </char></note>lapli ki sòti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:1">nan SENYÈ a nan epòk prentan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:1">Se SENYÈ a ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 10:13">Jr 10:13</ref></char></note>fè nwaj tanpèt yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:1">epi se Li ki bay lapli lejè a tout</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:1">pou jaden plant yo.<verse eid="ZEC 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:2" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 21:21">Éz 21:21</ref> </char></note>zidòl lakay yo pale inikite;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:2">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 27:9">Jr 27:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>divinò yo k ap fè vizyon ki pa vrè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:2">ke yo repete kòn fo rèv.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:2">Yo bay rekonfò an ven.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:2">Konsa, pèp la mache egare tankou mouton;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:2">yo aflije akoz yo pa gen bèje.<verse eid="ZEC 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:3" />Kòlè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:34-36">Jr 25:34-36</ref> </char></note>Mwen limen kont bèje yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:3">Mwen va pini mal kabrit yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:3">paske SENYÈ dèzame yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:12">Éz 34:12</ref></char></note>vizite</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:3">bann mouton li an lakay Juda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:3">e Li va fè yo vin tankou cheval</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:3">majeste Li nan batay la.<verse eid="ZEC 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:4" />De li menm, va vin parèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 20:17">Luc 20:17</ref></char></note>wòch ang lan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:4">de li menm, pikèt tant lan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:4">de li menm, banza batay la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:4">de li menm, tout wa yo ansanm.<verse eid="ZEC 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:5" />Yo va tankou mesye pwisan yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:5">k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 22:43">II Sam 22:43</ref></char></note>foule lènmi yo anba pye yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:5">nan labou lari a nan batay la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:5">Yo va goumen, paske SENYÈ a va avèk yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:5">epi sila ki monte sou cheval yo va anbwouye.<verse eid="ZEC 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:6" />Mwen va ranfòse lakay Juda a, Mwen va</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">sove lakay Joseph la, e</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 8:8">Za 8:8</ref> </char></note>fè yo retounen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">paske Mwen gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:8">És 54:8</ref></char></note>konpasyon pou yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">Konsa, yo va vin konsi Mwen pa t janm rejte yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">paske Mwen se SENYÈ a, Bondye yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">e mwen va reponn yo.<verse eid="ZEC 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:7" />Éphraïm va vin tankou yon gwo nonm pwisan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:7">e kè yo va kontan konsi se ak diven.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:7">Anverite, pitit yo va wè sa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:7">e yo va kontan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:7">kè yo va rejwi nan SENYÈ a.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">És 54:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="ZEC 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:8" />Mwen va soufle pou yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:8">pou yo kab vin rasanble yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:8">paske Mwen te rachte yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:8">Konsa, yo va vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 33:22">Jr 33:22</ref></char></note>anpil,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:8">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 36:11">Éz 36:11</ref> </char>
    </note>jan yo te ye oparavan an.<verse eid="ZEC 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:9" />Lè Mwen gaye yo pami lòt pèp yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:9">yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:47">I Wa 8:47</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 8:48">48</ref></char></note>sonje Mwen nan peyi lwen yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:9">Yo va viv ak pitit yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:9">e yo va retounen.<verse eid="ZEC 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:10" />Mwen va mennen yo retounen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:10">soti nan peyi Égypte la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:10">e rasanble yo soti Assyrie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:10">Mwen va mennen yo antre nan peyi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:10">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 50:19">Jr 50:19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Galaad ak Liban jiskaske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:19">És 49:19</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 49:20">20</ref> </char></note>pa gen espas pou yo.<verse eid="ZEC 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:11" />Li va pase nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 51:9">És 51:9</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 51:10">10</ref> </char></note>lanmè afliksyon an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">e Li va frape lanm lanmè yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">jiskaske tout pwofondè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 19:5-7">És 19:5-7</ref></char></note> Rivyè Nil lan vin sèch.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">Epi ògèy Assyrie va vin bese e</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">baton Égypte la va sòti.<verse eid="ZEC 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:12" />Mwen va ranfòse yo nan SENYÈ a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:12">Nan non pa Li, yo va mache monte desann” deklare SENYÈ a.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 4:5">Mi 4:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="ZEC 10:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ZEC 11" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:1" />Ouvri pòt ou yo, O Liban,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:1">pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:6">Jr 22:6</ref>,<ref loc="JER 22:7">7</ref></char></note>dife ka devore <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 31:3">Éz 31:3</ref> </char></note>bwa sèd ou yo.<verse eid="ZEC 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:2" />Rele anmwey, O pye siprè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:2">paske bwa sèd la fin tonbe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:2">akoz bèl ab plen ak glwa yo fin detwi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:2">Rele anmwey, O bwadchenn a Basan yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:2">paske gran forè a fin tonbe.<verse eid="ZEC 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:3" />Men yon vwa kriye lamantasyon a bèje yo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:3">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 25:34-36">Jr 25:34-36</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Paske glwa gran fore yo fin detwi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:3">yon vwa jenn lyon k ap gwonde a!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:3">Paske ògèy Jourdain nan fin kraze nèt.<verse eid="ZEC 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:4" />Konsa pale SENYÈ a, Bondye mwen an: “Nouri bann mouton k ap<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 44:22">Sòm 44:22</ref> </char></note>kòche a. <verse eid="ZEC 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:5" />Sila ki achte yo, kòche yo, e rete san koupabilite. Sila ki vann yo va di: ‘Beni se SENYÈ a, paske mwen vin rich!’ Epi pwòp bèje pa yo pa menm gen pitye pou yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 12:8">Os 12:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:2">Éz 34:2</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 34:3">3</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:6" />Paske Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 13:14">Jr 13:14</ref></char></note>p ap fè pitye ankò pou pèp peyi a,” deklare SENYÈ a; “men gade byen, Mwen va delivre tout mesye yo, yo tout anba men pwochen yo, e anba pouvwa a wa li a. Y ap frape peyi a, e Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 50:22">Sòm 50:22</ref> </char></note>p ap delivre yo anba pouvwa yo.”<verse eid="ZEC 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:7" />Konsa, mwen te nouri bann mouton pou kòche a; soutou, aflije nan bann mouton yo. Mwen te pran pou mwen de baton: youn mwen te rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 27:4">Sòm 27:4</ref></char></note>Gras e lòt la, mwen te rele li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 133:1">Sòm 133:1</ref> </char></note>Tèt Ansanm. Konsa, mwen te nouri bann mouton an. <verse eid="ZEC 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:8" />Epi mwen te koupe retire nèt twa bèje sila yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 5:7">Os 5:7</ref> </char></note>yon mwa, paske nanm mwen te pèdi pasyans avèk yo, e nanm pa yo te fatige avè m tou. <verse eid="ZEC 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:9" />Epi mwen te di: “Mwen p ap nouri nou. Sa ki fèt pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:2">Jr 15:2</ref> </char></note>mouri, kite l mouri, e sa ki fèt pou koupe retire nèt, kite l koupe retire. Epi konsa, kite sila ki rete yo manje chè youn lòt.” <verse eid="ZEC 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:10" />Mwen te pran baton Gras la, e mwen te koupe li an twa mòso pou m te kab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:39">Sòm 89:39</ref> </char></note>kraze akò ke m te fè ak tout pèp la. <verse eid="ZEC 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:11" />Konsa, li te kraze nan jou sa a. Epi konsa, aflije nan bann mouton yo ki t ap gade mwen an, te vin konprann ke se te pawòl SENYÈ a.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 3:12">So 3:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:12" />Mwen te di yo: “Si sa bon nan zye nou, peye m salè mwen an, men si se pa sa, pa okipe w.” Konsa, yo te peze trant sik ajan kòm salè mwen an.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:28">Jen 37:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:13" />Konsa, SENYÈ a te di mwen: “Jete sa vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:3-10">Mat 27:3-10</ref> </char></note>bòs potye a—pri manyifik valè M ki te estime pa yo menm nan!” Konsa, mwen te pran trant sik ajan, e mwen te jete yo vè bòs potye a, lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="ZEC 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:14" />Epi mwen te koupe an mòso dezyèm baton ki rele Tèt Ansanm nan, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:21">És 9:21</ref> </char></note>kraze fratènite ki te egziste antre Juda ak Israël la.<verse eid="ZEC 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:15" />SENYÈ a te di mwen: “Pran ankò pou ou menm, enstriman a yon bèje ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:10-12">És 6:10-12</ref> </char></note>san konprann. <verse eid="ZEC 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:16" />Paske, gade byen, Mwen ap fè leve yon bèje nan peyi a, yon bèje ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:2">Jr 23:2</ref> </char></note>p ap vizite sila ke yo koupe retire yo, ni chache sila ke yo gaye yo, ni geri sila ki aflije a, ni nouri sila ki ansante a, men li va devore chè a mouton gra yo, e li va menm chire retire zago yo. <verse eid="ZEC 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:17" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:1">Jr 23:1</ref> </char></note>Malè a bèje san valè ki abandone bann mouton an! Nepe va sou bra li ak sou zye dwat li! Bra li va vin seche nèt e zye dwat la va vin avèg nèt.”<verse eid="ZEC 11:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ZEC 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:1" />Pwofesi pawòl SENYÈ a konsènan Israël la. Konsa pale SENYÈ ki etann syèl yo a, ki poze fondasyon latè yo, e ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:16">És 57:16</ref> </char></note>kreye lespri a lòm nan anndan l lan. <verse eid="ZEC 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:2" />“Gade byen, Mwen ap fè Jérusalem vin yon tas ki va fè tout pèp ki antoure l yo, vin toudi. Epi nan lè syèj la kont Jérusalem nan, li va vin osi, kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 14:14">Za 14:14</ref> </char></note>Juda. <verse eid="ZEC 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:3" />Li va vin rive nan jou sa a, ke Mwen va fè Jérusalem vin yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:34">Dan 2:34</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 2:35">35</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 2:44">44</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 2:45">45</ref> </char></note>wòch ki lou pou tout pèp yo. Tout ki vin leve l va vin blese grav. Epi tout nasyon latè yo va rasanble ansanm kont li. <verse eid="ZEC 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:4" />Nan jou sa a,” deklare SENYÈ a: “Mwen va frape tout cheval yo pou l dezoryante, e chevalye yo avèk foli. Men Mwen va ouvri zye Mwen sou lakay Juda, pandan Mwen ap frape tout cheval a pèp nasyon yo, pou yo vin avèg. <verse eid="ZEC 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:5" />Konsa, tout chèf a Juda yo, va di nan kè yo: ‘Moun ki rete Jérusalem yo se fòs mwen nan SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye pa yo a.’<verse eid="ZEC 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:6" />Nan jou sa a, Mwen va fè chèf Juda yo vin tankou yon gwo boukan dife pami mòso bwa yo, ak yon tòch k ap fè flanm dife pami pakèt sereyal yo. Yo va devore tout pèp ki ozanviwon yo, ni sou men dwat yo, ni sou men goch yo, pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 2:4">Za 2:4</ref> </char></note>sila ki rete Jérusalem yo, va toujou demere nan pwòp lye pa yo Jérusalem.<verse eid="ZEC 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:7" />SENYÈ a va osi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:18">Jr 30:18</ref> </char></note>sove anpremye tant a Juda yo, pou glwa kay David la, e glwa a sila ki viv rete Jérusalem, p ap depase Juda. <verse eid="ZEC 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:8" />Nan jou sa a, SENYÈ a va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:16">Jl 3:16</ref></char></note>defann moun Jérusalem yo. Sila ki fèb pami yo nan jou sa a va tankou David, e kay David la va tankou Bondye, tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:19">Egz 14:19</ref> </char></note>zanj SENYÈ a devan yo. <verse eid="ZEC 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:9" />Epi nan jou sa a, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 14:2">Za 14:2</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 14:3">3</ref> </char></note>kòmanse detwi tout nasyon ki vini kont Jérusalem yo.<verse eid="ZEC 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:10" />Epi Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:3">És 44:3</ref></char></note>vide sou kay David la, ak sou moun Jérusalem yo, Lespri a gras, ak Lespri lapriyè pou mande mizerikòd. Konsa, yo va gade vè Mwen menm Sila ke yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:37">Jn 19:37</ref> </char></note>pèse a. Yo va soufri gwo doulè pou Li, tankou yon moun k ap fè dèy pou yon sèl fis li genyen, e yo va kriye anpil anpil sou Li jan yon moun ta kriye sou sèl fis inik li. <verse eid="ZEC 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:11" />Nan jou sa a, va gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:30">Mat 24:30</ref> </char></note>gwo doulè Jérusalem, tankou fè dèy pou Hadadrimmon nan vale Meguiddon an. <verse eid="ZEC 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:12" />Peyi a va kriye, chak fanmi apa; fanmi lakay David la, apa, e madanm yo, apa; fanmi lakay Nathan an, apa, e madanm yo apa; <verse eid="ZEC 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:13" />fanmi lakay Levi, apa, e madanm yo, apa; fanmi a Schimeï yo, apa, e madanm yo, apa; <verse eid="ZEC 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:14" />tout fanmi ki rete yo, chak fanmi apa; e madanm yo, apa.<verse eid="ZEC 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ZEC 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:1" />“Nan jou sa a, va gen yon fontèn dlo ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:13">Jr 2:13</ref></char></note> va ouvri pou lakay David, e pou sila ki rete Jérusalem yo, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:2">Sòm 51:2</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 51:7">7</ref> </char></note>peche ak salte.<verse eid="ZEC 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:2" />“Li va vin rive nan jou sa a”, deklare SENYÈ dèzame yo: “ke Mwen va koupe retire non a zidòl yo soti nan peyi a, e yo p ap sonje yo ankò. Mwen va osi retire <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:14">Jr 23:14</ref>,<ref loc="JER 23:15">15</ref></char></note>pwofèt yo ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:22">I Wa 22:22</ref> </char></note>lespri pa pwòp la soti nan peyi a. <verse eid="ZEC 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:3" />Lè yon moun va pwofetize, alò, papa l ak manman l ki te fè l la va di li: ‘Ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:20">Det 18:20</ref></char></note>p ap viv, paske ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:35">Jr 23:35</ref> </char></note>pale sa ki fo nan non SENYÈ a.’ Konsa, papa li ak manman li ki te fè l la, va fwennen l lè li pwofetize. <verse eid="ZEC 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:4" />Anplis, li va vin rive nan jou sa a, ke tout pwofèt yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:15">Jr 6:15</ref> </char></note>vin wont de vizyon yo fè, lè yo ap pwofetize. Yo p ap mete gwo wòb fèt an pwal pou twonpe moun; <verse eid="ZEC 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:5" />men yon pwofèt va di: ‘Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 7:14">Am 7:14</ref> </char></note>pa yon pwofèt; mwen se yon kiltivatè tè a, paske mwen se yon sèvitè atache nèt depi mwen jèn.’ <verse eid="ZEC 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:6" />Konsa, yon moun va vin di l: ‘Ki blesi sa ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:24">II Wa 9:24</ref> </char></note>nan mitan bra ou yo?’ Epi li va reponn: ‘Sa yo se blesi ke mwen te pran lakay zami mwen yo.’<verse eid="ZEC 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:7" />“Leve, O nepe, kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:11">És 40:11</ref> </char></note>bèje Mwen an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:7">e kont nonm nan ki byen pre M,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:7">deklare SENYÈ dèzame yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:7">Frape bèje a pou mouton yo ka gaye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:7">epi Mwen va vire men M kont jenn ti piti yo.<verse eid="ZEC 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:8" />“Sa va vin rive nan tout peyi a” deklare SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:8">“Ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:13">És 6:13</ref></char></note>de pati nan li va vin koupe retire pou l mouri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:8">men twazyèm pati a va rete ladann l.<verse eid="ZEC 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:9" />“Konsa, Mwen va mennen fè pase</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">twazyèm pati a nan dife.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">Mwen va rafine yo tankou yo rafine ajan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">e pase yo a leprèv tankou lò.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">Yo va rele non Mwen, e Mwen va tande yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">Mwen va di: ‘Yo se pèp Mwen’,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">e yo va di: ‘SENYÈ a, se Bondye mwen an.’”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 48:10">És 48:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="ZEC 13:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ZEC 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:1" />Gade byen, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:6">És 13:6</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 13:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:14">Za 14:14</ref> </char></note>jou pou SENYÈ a ap vini, jou lè piyaj ke yo rache de nou menm yo, va divize andedan nou. <verse eid="ZEC 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:2" />Paske Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:2">Za 12:2</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 12:3">3</ref> </char></note>rasanble tout nasyon yo kont Jérusalem pou batay. Vil la va vin kaptire, kay yo va piyaje, fanm yo va vyole. Mwatye nan vil la va voye an egzil, men rès a pèp la p ap koupe retire de vil la. <verse eid="ZEC 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:3" />Konsa, SENYÈ a va parèt pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:14">Za 9:14</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 9:15">15</ref> </char></note>goumen kont nasyon sila yo, jan Li goumen nan yon jou batay la. <verse eid="ZEC 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:4" />Nan jou sa a, pye Li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:23">Éz 11:23</ref></char></note>poze sou Mòn Olivier a, ki devan Jérusalem sou pati lès la. Epi Mòn Olivier a va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 64:1">És 64:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 64:2">2</ref> </char></note>fann nan mitan soti nan lès pou rive nan lwès, e va gen yon gwo gwo vale. Mwatye nan mòn nan va deplase vè nò e lòt mwatye a vè sid. <verse eid="ZEC 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:5" />Nou va sove ale pa vale a mòn Mwen yo, paske vale a mòn yo va rive jis Atzel. Wi, nou va sove ale menm jan ke nou te sove ale devan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:6">És 29:6</ref> </char></note>tranbleman tè nan jou Ozias la, wa Juda a. Epi SENYÈ a, Bondye mwen an va vini e tout sen fidèl yo va avèk Li!<verse eid="ZEC 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:6" />Nan jou sa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">És 13:10</ref> </char></note> p ap gen limyè, ni fredi, ni glas sou tè. <verse eid="ZEC 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:7" />Li va yon jou inik ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:21">És 45:21</ref></char></note>konnen pa SENYÈ a; li p ap ni lajounen ni lannwit, men li va vin rive ke nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 58:10">És 58:10</ref> </char></note>aswè, va gen limyè.<verse eid="ZEC 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:8" />Li va rive nan jou sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:1-12">Éz 47:1-12</ref> </char></note> kouran dlo yo va koule sòti Jérusalem; mwatye nan yo vè pati lès lanmè a, e lòt mwatye a vè pati lwès lanmè a. Li va konsa ni nan sezon ete ni nan sezon ivè.<verse eid="ZEC 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:9" />Epi SENYÈ a va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:2-4">És 2:2-4</ref> </char></note>wa sou tout tè a. Nan jou sa a, SENYÈ a va yon sèl, e non Li va yon sèl.<verse eid="ZEC 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:10" />Tout peyi a va devni yon savann, depi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:22">I Wa 15:22</ref></char></note>Guéba jis rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:32">Jos 15:32</ref> </char></note>Rimmon, nan sid Jérusalem. Men Jérusalem va vin leve, e rete nan plas li soti nan Pòtay Benjamin an, jis rive nan pozisyon premye Pòtay la, pou janbe nan Pòtal Kwen an, e soti nan tou Hananéel la, jis rive nan pèz diven a wa a. <verse eid="ZEC 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:11" />Moun yo va viv ladann, e p ap gen malediksyon ankò, paske Jérusalem va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:5">Jr 23:5</ref>,<ref loc="JER 23:6">6</ref> </char></note>rete ansekirite.<verse eid="ZEC 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:12" />Men sa va fleyo avèk sila SENYÈ a va frape tout pèp ki te fè lagè kont Jérusalem yo: chè yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:16">Lev 26:16</ref> </char></note>pouri pandan yo kanpe sou pye yo, zye yo va pouri nan tèt yo, e lang yo va pouri nan pwòp bouch yo. <verse eid="ZEC 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:13" />Li va vin rive nan jou sa a ke yon gwo panik ki sòti nan SENYÈ a va tonbe sou yo. Konsa, chak va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 11:6">Za 11:6</ref> </char></note>kenbe men vwazen l, e men a youn va vin leve kont men a lòt la. <verse eid="ZEC 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:14" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:2">Za 12:2</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 12:5">5</ref> </char></note> Anplis, Juda va goumen nan Jérusalem. Richès a tout nasyon ki ozanviwon yo va vin rasanble ansanm; lò, ajan ak vètman an gran kantite.<verse eid="ZEC 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:15" />Jan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 14:12">Za 14:12</ref> </char></note>fleyo sa a ye a, se konsa tou fleyo a va ye sou cheval, milèt, chamo, bourik ak tout bèf ki va nan kan sa yo.<verse eid="ZEC 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:16" />Epi li va vin rive ke tout moun ki rete nan tout nasyon ki te ale kont Jérusalem yo, yo tout va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:6-9">És 60:6-9</ref></char></note>ale monte ane pa ane pou adore Wa a, SENYÈ Dèzame yo, e pou selebre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:34-44">Lev 23:34-44</ref> </char></note>Fèt Tonèl yo. <verse eid="ZEC 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:17" />Epi sa va rive ke nenpòt moun nan fanmi sou latè yo ki pa monte Jérusalem pou adore Wa a, SENYÈ Dèzame yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:3-6">Jr 14:3-6</ref> </char></note>Lapli p ap tonbe sou yo. <verse eid="ZEC 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:18" />Si fanmi peyi Egypte la pa monte oswa pa vini; alò, lapli p ap tonbe sou yo. Va gen fleyo ke SENYÈ a te frape nasyon ki pa t monte pou selebre Fèt Tonèl Yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 14:12">Za 14:12</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 14:15">15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:19" />Sa va pinisyon Egypte la ak pinisyon a tout nasyon ki pa monte pou selebre Fèt Tonèl yo.<verse eid="ZEC 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:20" />Nan jou sa a, va gen anons sa sou klòch cheval yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:36-38">Egz 28:36-38</ref> </char></note>“SEN A SENYÈ A”. Epi chodyè ki kwit manje lakay SENYÈ yo, va tankou bòl devan lotèl yo. <verse eid="ZEC 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:21" />Tout chodyè pou kwit manje Jérusalem ak Juda yo, va vin sen pou SENYÈ Dèzame yo; epi tout moun ki fè sakrifis yo va vin pran yo, e bouyi sakrifis ladan yo. Epi p ap gen ankò, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 1:11">So 1:11</ref> </char></note>Kananeyen nan kay SENYÈ Dèzame yo nan jou sa a.<verse eid="ZEC 14:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 14" />
</usx>